  <rules>
    <rule name="Return to the Warp" id="4204-3235-e175-9161" hidden="false">
      <description>At the end of your Morale phase, you can select any number of FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS units without CHARACTER Keyword of your Army to be returned to the Warp.
Remove the models of these units from the Battlefield. Those models and units are not considered to be destroyed.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Warp Storm effects, Tzeentch" id="0af0-9a58-9cfd-960c" hidden="true">
      <comment>TZEENTCH----------------------------------------------
4WSP-----&gt;DELUGE OF FIRE
Use this effect at the start of your Shooting phase. Until the end of the phase, improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS TZEENTCH models from your army by 1.

3WSP-----&gt;SORCEROUS WINDS
Use this effect at the start of your Psychic phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a Psychic test is taken for a FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS TZEENTCH unit from your army, add 1 to that Psychic test.

4WSP-----&gt;RAMPANT MUTATION
Use this effect in the Fight phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS TZEENTCH model from your army makes a melee attack, an unmodified wound roll of 6 inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage.</comment>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Warp Storm effects, Slaanesh" id="c523-b99b-9170-0d94" hidden="true">
      <comment>SLAANESH----------------------------------------------
4WSP-----&gt;MESMERISING DANCE
Use this effect at the start of the Fight phase. Until the end of the phase, substract 1 from the Attacks characteristic (to a minimun of 1) of models in enemy units within engagement range of FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS SLAANESH units from your army.

3WSP-----&gt;LIGHTNING SPEED
Use this effect in your Movement or Charge phase. Until the end of the turn, each time an Advance roll or Charge roll is made for a FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS SLAANESH unit from your army, add 1 to the result.

2WSP-----&gt;DARK HALLUCINATIONS
Use this effect at the start of your opponent’s turn. Until the end of the turn, while an enemy unit is wholly within 12&quot; of one or more FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS SLAANESH units from your army, each time that enemy unit starts to perform an action, roll 2D6. If the result is greater than that enemy unit’s Leadership characteristic, that action fails and that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</comment>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Warp Storm effects, Nurgle" id="84c2-53bc-4c2e-747e" hidden="true">
      <comment>NURGLE------------------------------------------------
4WSP-----&gt;SWARMING INSECTS
Use this effect at the start of the Fight phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS NURGLE model from your army makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.

2WSP-----&gt;PLAGUE OF RUST
Use this effect at the start of the Fight phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS NURGLE model from your army makes a melee attack against an enemy VEHICLE unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.

2WSP-----&gt;WAVE OF SICKNESS
Use this effect at the start of your Shooting phase. Roll one D6 for each enemy unit wholly within 12&quot; of one or more FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS NURGLE units from your army. On a 6, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. Each unit can be affected by this ability once per phase.</comment>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Warp Storm effects, Khorne" id="3100-2e02-5dfa-db44" hidden="true">
      <comment>KHORNE------------------------------------------------
4WSP-----&gt;FURY OF KHORNE
Use this effect at the start of the Fight phase. Until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS KHORNE models from your army.

2WSP-----&gt;BURNING TERROR
Use this effect at the start of your Shooting phase. Roll one D6 for each enemy unit wholly within 12&quot; of any FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS KHORNE units from your army and that is not wholly within an Area Terrain feature. On a 6, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. Each unit can be affected by this ability once per phase.

4WSP-----&gt;OVERWHELMING RAGE
Use this effect at the start of your opponent’s Movement phase. Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy unit (excluding AIRCRAFT units) within Engagement Range of any FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS KHORNE units from your army is selected to Fall Back, roll one D6: on a 4+, that unit cannot Fall Back.</comment>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
