                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS KHORNE CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Lord of Decapitations" id="d07b-6228-1f3a-6ab0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly BLOODLETTERS unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Skulls for Khorne" id="a4f1-6d41-ed70-4e6d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model makes a melee attack against an enemy CHARACTER unit, you can re-roll the hit roll and you can re-roll the wound roll.
Each time an enemy CHARACTER unit is destroyed by an attack made by this model, increase the range of this model’s Herald of Khorne and Lord of Decapitations abilities by 3&quot; (to a maximum of 12&quot;).</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
