                <profile name="Disease of Mirth" id="1875-caeb-de01-cbc7" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the Morale phase, you can select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of this model and roll 2D6: if the result is greater than that enemy unit’s Leadership characteristic:
- The selected unit cannot perform actions, and if that unit is currently performing an action, it immediately fails.
- The selected unit loses the Objective Secured ability.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Herald of Nurgle [Aura]" id="5149-05da-eb4b-d2ed" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS NURGLE CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Jolly Gutpipes" id="caac-c005-fe9f-9e51" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS NURGLE unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase:
- Add 1 to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.
- Add 1 to Advance and charge rolls made for this unit.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
