                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of the Fight phase, you can select one enemy model within 3&quot; of the bearer that lost any wounds during that phase as a result of an attack made by the bearer. Roll one D6: on a 2+, that model suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
