          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FLESH HOUNDS unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a wound roll of 1. If the target is a PSYKER unit, you can re-roll the wound roll instead.</characteristic>
