          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit makes an attack with its gore-drenched fangs, if that model’s unit made a charge move or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attack’s Damage characteristic.</characteristic>
