        <profile name="Emissary of the Great Mutator [Aura]" id="cdcb-769b-e382-827a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS TZEENTCH CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
