                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD:
- Each time a Morale test is taken for that unit, your opponent must roll one additional D6 and discard the lowest result.
- If that unit fails a Morale test, until the end of the phase, it is considered to be below Half-strength for the purposes of Combat Attrition tests.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
