              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against this model, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails. Subtract 1 from that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
