              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Psychic phase, roll one D6 for each enemy unit that suffered any mortal wounds as a result of a psychic power manifested by this model this turn: on a 2+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
