                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Treason of Tzeentch has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, that enemy unit is not affected by the aura abilities of other enemy units.</characteristic>
