                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Infernal Flames has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS TZEENTCH CORE unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER.
