                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Infernal Gateway has a warp charge value of 8. If manifested, the closest enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER and each other enemy unit within 3&quot; of that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
If the result of the Psychic test was 12 or more, each affected unit suffers 3 mortal wounds instead.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
