                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Stream of Corruption has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, the closest enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER suffers D3 mortal wounds. If that unit contains 11 or more models, that unit suffers D3+2 mortal wounds instead.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
