                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Shrivelling Pox has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one enemy unit without INORGANIC or VEHICLE Keywords within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, subtract 1 from the Toughness characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
