                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Virulent Blessing has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS NURGLE CORE unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER.
Until the start of your next Psychic phase, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of melee weapons models in that unit are equipped with.</characteristic>
