                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Cacophonic Choir has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, roll 2D6. The closest enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER suffers 1 mortal wound for each point that the result exceeds that enemy unit’s Leadership characteristic by.</characteristic>
