                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Symphony of Pain has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a melee attack is made by a model in that unit, subtract 1 from that attack’s hit roll and wound roll.</characteristic>
