                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Delightful Agonies has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one friendly FACTION: CHAOS DAEMONS SLAANESH CORE unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER.
Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
