                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack with a Damage characteristic of 1 is allocated to the bearer, add 1 to any saving throw made against that attack.
- Each time the bearer would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound in the Psychic phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
