              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy PSYKER unit is within 12&quot; of the bearer:
- Each time a Psychic test is taken for that unit, it suffers Perils of the Warp on any dice roll that includes a double, instead of only a double 1 or double 6.
- Each time that unit suffers Perils of the Warp, it suffers D6 mortal wounds instead of D3.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
